There are thousands of Eggnog recipes out there and just as many Eggnog Ice Cream recipes.....this is ours!

We've used lovely orange yolks along with Old J Spiced rum but you can use any alcohol you want, Jack Daniels, Cpt Morgans, Baileys etc etc the choice is yours. 

What you'll need:
350g Whole Milk
350g Cream (Double or Heavy)
50g Brown Sugar
120g White Sugar
60g Skimmed Milk Powder
5 Egg yolks
5g Ground Nutmeg (Fresh is best but dried is fine)
70g Spiced Rum (or alcohol of choice)
5g Vanilla Paste or extract

Some people replace the milk with store bought eggnog and call it a day...... this is completely up to you although the store bought eggnog I tried was HORRID and you end up with a really sub-par ice cream flavour. 

